Python File Handling – Practice Questions

These exercises are designed to help to practice Python file handling concepts including
reading files, writing files, append mode.
---
Write a Python program to create a file named students.txt and write five student names into it.
---
Write a program to read the entire content of students.txt and print it.
---
Write a program to append a new student name into students.txt without deleting existing data.
---
Write a program to count the total number of characters present in a file.
---
Write a program to demonstrate the use of tell() by printing the cursor position before and after reading some characters.
---
Write a program to demonstrate seek() by moving the cursor back to the beginning of the file after reading some data.
---